### GET /.well-known/jwks.json — public keys for offline JWT validation
###
### When to use: to inspect which public key auth-service uses to sign tokens,
### and to confirm what matchmaking-api fetches on startup. You normally only
### run this for troubleshooting auth issues — matchmaking-api reads it
### automatically.
###
### How to use: start auth-service, then run the request below.
### Expected: 200 with { "keys": [ { "kty": "RSA", "alg": "RS256", "kid": ... } ] }.

@authBaseUrl = http://localhost:8081

GET {{authBaseUrl}}/.well-known/jwks.json
